==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' July ''9<sup>th</sup>'' - July ''23<sup>rd</sup>'', 2026
** Two Single-Round Robin Groups
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|seedup|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to ''Playoffs''
**{{Bgcolortext|up|3<sup>rd</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-Ins Upper Bracket Round 2'', an opening loss will send them to ''Lower Bracket Quarterfinal''
** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|4<sup>th</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-Ins Upper Bracket Round 2'', an opening loss will send them to ''Lower Bracket Round 1''
** {{Bgcolortext|stay|6<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-Ins Upper Bracket Round 1''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* 12 Teams are divided into 6 seeds as per their final standings in [[VCT/2026/China League/Stage 1|Stage 1 2026]].
* 2 seeds are grouped into a single pool, 3 pools are formed.
* A representative draw slip (Slips with #1, #2 etc. written) will be placed into three pools.
* Each Pool will select a single draw slip.
* The chosen seed in the slip will swap groups for Stage 2 as follows:
** '''Pool 1''' consists of top two teams from each group of Stage 1:
*** '''#1 Seeds: {{Team|ag cn}} & {{Team|edg}}
*** '''#2 Seeds: {{Team|jdg}} & {{Team|xlg}}
** '''Pool 2''' consists of the 3rd & 4th teams from each group of Stage 1:
*** '''#3 Seeds: {{Team|tyloo}} & {{Team|drg}}
*** '''#4 Seeds: {{Team|tec}} & {{Team|trace}}
** '''Pool 3''' consists of the 5th & 6th teams from each group of Stage 1:
*** '''#5 Seeds: {{Team|blg}} & {{Team|nova cn}}
*** '''#6 Seeds: {{Team|fpx}} & {{Team|Wolves Esports}}
* [https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R55E61EEt?p=8 Click here for replay of Group Stage Draw]
</div></div>
*<span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-left:45px">
*'''Tiebreaker rules:'''
*#Head-to-head Match Score
*#Head-to-head Map Differential
*#Head-to-head Round Differential
*#Map Differential
*#Round Differential
*In a 3+ team tiebreaker, if it was able to tiebreak some teams, but a subset of teams remain tied, a new tiebreaker is then applied from the beginning.
</div></div>
* '''Seed Deciders:''' July ''24<sup>th</sup>'' - July ''26<sup>th</sup>'', 2026
** Teams with the same placement from each group play a single match to determine their Regular Season placements and ''Playoffs/Play-Ins'' seeds
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
* '''Play-Ins:''' August ''5<sup>th</sup>'' - August ''12<sup>th</sup>'', 2026
** 10-team Double-Elimination bracket
*** 8 teams from '''[[VCT/2025/China League/Stage 2/Group Stage|Group Stage]]'''
*** 2 teams from the '''[[China_National_Tournament/2026/Pro_Qualifier|China National Tournament]]'''
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} advance to ''Playoffs''
* '''Playoffs:''' August ''14<sup>th</sup>'' - August ''23<sup>th</sup>'', 2026
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} qualify for '''[[VCT/2026/Champions|Champions]]'''

